cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "fdo-squirrel-md-generator"
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this
  file.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Florian
    family-names: Thiery
    affiliation: Research Squirrel Engineers Network
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3246-3531"
repository-code: "https://github.com/FDOx-squirrel/fdo-squirrel-md-generator"
abstract: >-
  A static, browser-only MD.cff / CITATION.cff editor for the FDOx-squirrel
  family: builds a new MD.cff against fdo-squirrel's live schema, loads an
  existing MD.cff or a whole FDOx bundle .zip back in for editing, and
  runs a structural pre-check (schema validity, expected files, checksums)
  on ZIP bundles -- entirely client-side, deployed on GitHub Pages.
keywords:
  - FAIR Digital Object
  - metadata
  - CITATION.cff
  - JSON Schema
  - cultural heritage
license: MIT
version: v0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-07"
